LavBench database migrations
============================

From the ``backend/`` directory, run ``python scripts/migrate.py`` before starting the API or
workers. The runner upgrades a fresh or versioned database, and adopts an existing pre-Alembic
database only when its reflected schema exactly matches the baseline. It rejects drift and unknown
revisions, then fails closed if revision verification does not reach the expected head.

Generate reviewed revisions with ``alembic revision --autogenerate -m "summary"``.
